WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:08.335
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> What is a bucket list?

2
00:00:09.562 --> 00:00:13.562
It’s a list of things that you want to do before you die.

3
00:00:15.204 --> 00:00:22.047
The expression comes from an English idiom, to kick the bucket, which means to die.

4
00:00:24.996 --> 00:00:28.369
Some people make a new bucket list every year.

5
00:00:29.703 --> 00:00:34.259
Others start one when they’re young, and keep on adding to it.

6
00:00:35.857 --> 00:00:39.283
Others set a time limit, for example,

7
00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:43.097
‘Things I want to do before I’m thirty’.

8
00:00:46.108 --> 00:00:49.172
What kind of things do people put on them?

9
00:00:49.675 --> 00:00:51.750
All sorts of things.

10
00:00:52.324 --> 00:00:54.770
Many are to do with travel,

11
00:00:55.564 --> 00:01:01.074
for example, travel to all seven continents,

12
00:01:03.458 --> 00:01:05.012
go on a cruise,

13
00:01:07.502 --> 00:01:09.585
see the Northern Lights,

14
00:01:11.139 --> 00:01:12.879
go on a safari.

15
00:01:14.839 --> 00:01:17.276
Others are about adventures,

16
00:01:18.124 --> 00:01:21.753
for example, do a bungee jump,

17
00:01:23.828 --> 00:01:25.841
swim with dolphins,

18
00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:29.902
ride a horse on the beach.

19
00:01:33.858 --> 00:01:36.524
Some involve learning new skills,

20
00:01:37.628 --> 00:01:41.407
for example, learn to scuba dive,

21
00:01:42.696 --> 00:01:44.639
learn to play an instrument,

22
00:01:46.405 --> 00:01:48.303
learn to play chess,

23
00:01:50.254 --> 00:01:52.144
go on a cookery course.

24
00:01:54.219 --> 00:01:58.183
And others are just random things people would like to do,

25
00:01:59.587 --> 00:02:03.490
for example, see the sun rise,

26
00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:06.651
go on a blind date,

27
00:02:08.496 --> 00:02:10.536
be an extra in a film,

28
00:02:12.575 --> 00:02:14.200
get a tattoo,

29
00:02:15.886 --> 00:02:17.626
be on TV,

30
00:02:20.027 --> 00:02:22.606
see a tennis match at Wimbledon,

31
00:02:24.327 --> 00:02:26.385
read a classic novel.

32
00:02:28.972 --> 00:02:32.265
What would you put on your bucket list?